# Input

```md
# Spacing kept after the marker

-   wide

    paragraph

-    wider

     paragraph

# Blocks that keep their source indentation

- item

  <div>
    html
  </div>

      indented code

  > quote
  > more

  [ref]: /url

  paragraph

# Nested list that cannot move

- item
  - nested
    > quote

  paragraph

# List in a blockquote

> - item
>
>   paragraph
>   - nested

# First block

- - nested
  - sibling

  paragraph

# Paragraph line that starts with a block marker

- item

  The count is
  14. More text.

  paragraph

```


# Options

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "formatter": {
      "indentWidth": 8
    },
    "parser": {
      "gfm": true
    }
  }
}
```

